  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is the harmonic mean&nbsp;between <math> <mrow> <mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow> </math> and <math> <mrow> <mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow> </math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></math> are in"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "arithmetic progression",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "geometric progression",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "harmonic progression",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "None of these",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "It is given that,&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> are in harmonic progression.<br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> are in arithmetic progression.<br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math> <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Hence, <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></math> are in geometric progression"
  }
